# Not-found handling (2026-08-30): the previous SPA catch-all
#   /* /index.html 200
# served the homepage with HTTP 200 for every unknown path (soft-404 — bad for
# SEO, and relative asset URLs broke on deep unknown paths). Removed.
#
# Unknown paths now fall through to /404.html, which Cloudflare Pages serves
# automatically with a real 404 status. Real pages are unaffected: Pages'
# built-in pretty URLs resolve /about → about.html, /frameworks/ →
# frameworks/index.html, etc. (audited 2026-08-30: all 122 internal hrefs and
# all 83 sitemap entries map to real files).
